<h1>Contact Pilot Protocol</h1>
<p>Questions, app publishing, partnerships or press: email <a href="mailto:founders@pilotprotocol.network">founders@pilotprotocol.network</a> or use the <a href="/contact">contact form</a>. Submissions go directly to the founding team, who reply by email.</p>

<h2>Topics</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Question: about Pilot Protocol, the data service agents, the App Store or Pilot Cloud. The <a href="/plain/docs">documentation</a> may already have the answer.</li>
  <li>App publishing: apps are submitted through the <a href="/plain/publish">publish page</a>. Write to us if a submission is stuck or you have a question about the review.</li>
  <li>Partnership.</li>
  <li>Press: also <a href="mailto:press@pilotprotocol.network">press@pilotprotocol.network</a>.</li>
  <li>Correction: if something on this site is wrong, tell us the page and what it should say.</li>
  <li>Other.</li>
</ul>
<p>Please do not include passwords, keys or other secrets. Bug and vulnerability reports should use the <a href="/security/disclosure">dedicated disclosure form</a>.</p>
</PlainLayout>
